---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
    titre="Outils Premium Albion Online"
    description="Les outils Premium d’Albion Online, optimisés pour votre compte : Builder Tryhard et bientôt d’autres."
>
    <main class="wrap pt-8 pb-16 flex flex-col gap-8">
        <nav aria-label="Fil d’Ariane" class="crumbs">
            <span><a href="index.html">Accueil</a></span>
            <span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="albion.html">Albion Online</a></span>
            <span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Premium</span></span>
        </nav>

        <section class="pt-3 pb-2 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-5 reveal">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 lg:w-[850px]">
                <p class="font-mono font-medium text-[11px] text-brandOrange">ALBION ONLINE / PREMIUM</p>
                <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold">Aller plus loin, pour votre compte.</h1>
                <p class="text-base leading-[1.6] text-textMuted">
                    Des outils personnalisés pour affiner vos choix. Sélectionnez celui que vous voulez débloquer.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:items-end pb-[5px]">
                <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brandOrange">1 OUTIL DISPONIBLE · 8 BIENTÔT</p>
                <p class="text-[13px] text-textMuted">Mises à jour à chaque patch</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section aria-label="Catalogue des outils Premium">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <a
                    href="albion-builder-tryhard.html"
                    class="tool-card card-link reveal"
                    style="--d: 0s; --card-accent: var(--orange)"
                >
                    <div class="tool-card-visual">
                        <img
                            class="cover"
                            src="assets/img/maquette/outil-build-perso-carte.webp"
                            alt=""
                            width="1584"
                            height="672"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                        <span class="badge badge-premium"
                            ><img src="assets/icons/lock-keyhole.svg" alt="" />PREMIUM</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 p-[22px] flex-1">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] md:h-12">Builder Tryhard</h3>
                        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-textMuted md:h-[42px]">
                            Le builder poussé, optimisé pour votre personnage et votre façon de jouer.
                        </p>
                        <p class="flex items-center justify-between h-6 mt-auto">
                            <span class="card-hint text-[13px] font-semibold">Accéder →</span
                            ><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-textFaint">ALBION ONLINE</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <div class="tool-card card-soon reveal" style="--d: 0.1s" aria-disabled="true">
                    <div class="tool-card-visual">
                        <img
                            class="cover"
                            src="assets/img/maquette/outil-craft.webp"
                            alt=""
                            width="1584"
                            height="672"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                        <span class="badge badge-premium"
                            ><img src="assets/icons/lock-keyhole.svg" alt="" />PREMIUM</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 p-[22px] flex-1">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] md:h-12">Planificateur de craft</h3>
                        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-textMuted md:h-[42px]">
                            Organisez vos fabrications et anticipez les ressources à réunir.
                        </p>
                        <p class="flex items-center justify-between h-6 mt-auto">
                            <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-textFaint">Bientôt</span
                            ><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-textFaint">ALBION ONLINE</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tool-card card-soon reveal" style="--d: 0.2s" aria-disabled="true">
                    <div class="tool-card-visual">
                        <img
                            class="cover"
                            src="assets/img/maquette/outil-guilde.webp"
                            alt=""
                            width="1584"
                            height="672"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                        <span class="badge badge-premium"
                            ><img src="assets/icons/lock-keyhole.svg" alt="" />PREMIUM</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 p-[22px] flex-1">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] md:h-12">Panel de guilde</h3>
                        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-textMuted md:h-[42px]">
                            Rassemblez les informations utiles pour préparer les activités de votre guilde.
                        </p>
                        <p class="flex items-center justify-between h-6 mt-auto">
                            <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-textFaint">Bientôt</span
                            ><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-textFaint">ALBION ONLINE</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tool-card card-soon reveal" style="--d: 0s" aria-disabled="true">
                    <div class="tool-card-visual">
                        <img
                            class="cover"
                            src="assets/img/maquette/outil-marche.webp"
                            alt=""
                            width="1584"
                            height="672"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                        <span class="badge badge-premium"
                            ><img src="assets/icons/lock-keyhole.svg" alt="" />PREMIUM</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 p-[22px] flex-1">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] md:h-12">Suivi du marché</h3>
                        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-textMuted md:h-[42px]">
                            Comparez les tendances des objets pour éclairer vos décisions d’achat.
                        </p>
                        <p class="flex items-center justify-between h-6 mt-auto">
                            <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-textFaint">Bientôt</span
                            ><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-textFaint">ALBION ONLINE</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tool-card card-soon reveal" style="--d: 0.1s" aria-disabled="true">
                    <div class="tool-card-visual">
                        <img
                            class="cover"
                            src="assets/img/maquette/outil-rentabilite.webp"
                            alt=""
                            width="1584"
                            height="672"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                        <span class="badge badge-premium"
                            ><img src="assets/icons/lock-keyhole.svg" alt="" />PREMIUM</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 p-[22px] flex-1">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] md:h-12">Calculateur de rentabilité</h3>
                        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-textMuted md:h-[42px]">
                            Mettez en perspective vos coûts et vos gains avant de vous lancer.
                        </p>
                        <p class="flex items-center justify-between h-6 mt-auto">
                            <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-textFaint">Bientôt</span
                            ><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-textFaint">ALBION ONLINE</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tool-card card-soon reveal" style="--d: 0.2s" aria-disabled="true">
                    <div class="tool-card-visual">
                        <img
                            class="cover"
                            src="assets/img/maquette/outil-pvp.webp"
                            alt=""
                            width="1584"
                            height="672"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                        <span class="badge badge-premium"
                            ><img src="assets/icons/lock-keyhole.svg" alt="" />PREMIUM</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 p-[22px] flex-1">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] md:h-12">Simulateur PvP</h3>
                        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-textMuted md:h-[42px]">
                            Explorez vos choix d’équipement avant votre prochain affrontement.
                        </p>
                        <p class="flex items-center justify-between h-6 mt-auto">
                            <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-textFaint">Bientôt</span
                            ><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-textFaint">ALBION ONLINE</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tool-card card-soon reveal" style="--d: 0s" aria-disabled="true">
                    <div class="tool-card-visual">
                        <img
                            class="cover"
                            src="assets/img/maquette/outil-progression.webp"
                            alt=""
                            width="1584"
                            height="672"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                        <span class="badge badge-premium"
                            ><img src="assets/icons/lock-keyhole.svg" alt="" />PREMIUM</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 p-[22px] flex-1">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] md:h-12">Plan de progression</h3>
                        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-textMuted md:h-[42px]">
                            Tracez les prochaines étapes adaptées aux objectifs de votre personnage.
                        </p>
                        <p class="flex items-center justify-between h-6 mt-auto">
                            <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-textFaint">Bientôt</span
                            ><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-textFaint">ALBION ONLINE</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tool-card card-soon reveal" style="--d: 0.1s" aria-disabled="true">
                    <div class="tool-card-visual">
                        <img
                            class="cover"
                            src="assets/img/maquette/outil-alertes.webp"
                            alt=""
                            width="1584"
                            height="672"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                        <span class="badge badge-premium"
                            ><img src="assets/icons/lock-keyhole.svg" alt="" />PREMIUM</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 p-[22px] flex-1">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] md:h-12">Alertes de prix</h3>
                        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-textMuted md:h-[42px]">
                            Définissez les objets et les seuils que vous souhaitez surveiller.
                        </p>
                        <p class="flex items-center justify-between h-6 mt-auto">
                            <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-textFaint">Bientôt</span
                            ><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-textFaint">ALBION ONLINE</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tool-card card-soon reveal" style="--d: 0.2s" aria-disabled="true">
                    <div class="tool-card-visual">
                        <img
                            class="cover"
                            src="assets/img/maquette/outil-zvz.webp"
                            alt=""
                            width="1584"
                            height="672"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                        <span class="badge badge-premium"
                            ><img src="assets/icons/lock-keyhole.svg" alt="" />PREMIUM</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 p-[22px] flex-1">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] md:h-12">Logistique ZvZ</h3>
                        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-textMuted md:h-[42px]">
                            Préparez les équipements et les ressources pour vos combats de groupe.
                        </p>
                        <p class="flex items-center justify-between h-6 mt-auto">
                            <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-textFaint">Bientôt</span
                            ><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-textFaint">ALBION ONLINE</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <a href="albion-gratuit.html" class="invite card-link reveal" style="--card-accent: var(--mint)">
            <span class="flex flex-col gap-2"
                ><span class="text-lg">Vous préférez commencer par les bases ?</span
                ><span class="text-[13px] text-textMuted"
                    >Les outils gratuits restent accessibles, sans compte.</span
                ></span
            >
            <span class="card-hint text-sm font-semibold">Voir les outils gratuits →</span>
        </a>
    </main>
</Base>
